ABOUT SPITFIRE-X BBS SOFTWARE

Spitfire-X (SFX) is a new Windows and Linux BBS project. Inspired by the 
classic Spitfire experience, our goal is simple: keep the familiar 
personality of a Spitfire BBS while building a foundation for today's 
systems and callers.

Familiar menus, message echoes, bulletins and terminal interaction
remain central to the experience. Modern features are added thoughtfully,
with established BBS software and standards guiding the design.

SFX is actively being developed and tested. Features are introduced in
stages, and real caller feedback helps us improve reliability, wording
and usability.

If something looks confusing or does not work as expected, please
leave a message for the Sysop. Your testing helps shape SFX.

Thanks for visiting SFX HQ and being part of the next chapter!